  "prefLabel": "Rev 601.01 Abatement review",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 601.01 “Abatement review” means to make an assessment recommendation to the municipal assessing officials or to make a change to an assessment that is in response to an abatement request from a taxpayer.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Rev 600) #10581, eff 5-1-14; ss by #13916, eff 3-28-24 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Rev 600)",
